    {
      "source": "Map a <a href=\"../query/Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> with a <a href=\"../mapping/CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>type hint</code></a>. Update mapping translates property names\nto column names and maps <a href=\"../query/Update.AssignmentOp.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>update operation</code></a> values to simple Cassandra values.",
      "translation": "将 <a href=\"../query/Update.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>Update</code></a> 与带有 <a href=\"../mapping/CassandraPersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.mapping\"><code>类型提示</code></a> 的映射进行关联。更新映射会将属性名称转换为列名，并将 <a href=\"../query/Update.AssignmentOp.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.query\"><code>更新操作</code></a> 的值映射为简单的 Cassandra 值。",
